    "content": "::HEADER_START::\nGENERAL POWER OF ATTORNEY (GPA)\n(Executed on Non-Judicial Stamp Paper)\n::HEADER_END::\n\nTO ALL TO WHOM THESE PRESENTS SHALL COME, I, {{principal_name}}, S/o {{principal_father}}, aged about {{principal_age}} years, residing at: {{principal_address}}, holding Aadhaar No.: {{principal_aadhaar}} and PAN: {{principal_pan}} (hereinafter called the 'PRINCIPAL / EXECUTANT'):\n\nSEND GREETINGS:\n\nWHEREAS {{reason_for_gpa}};\n\nAND WHEREAS I repose complete trust and confidence in my {{attorney_relation}}, {{attorney_name}}, S/o {{attorney_father}}, aged about {{attorney_age}} years, residing at: {{attorney_address}}, holding Aadhaar No.: {{attorney_aadhaar}} and PAN: {{attorney_pan}};\n\nNOW KNOW YE ALL AND THESE PRESENTS WITNESS that I, the Principal, do hereby nominate, constitute, and appoint the said {{attorney_name}} as my true and lawful GENERAL ATTORNEY in my name and on my behalf to do, execute, and perform all or any of the following acts, deeds, and things:\n\n1. PROPERTY MANAGEMENT: To look after, manage, supervise, maintain, and protect all my movable and immovable properties, houses, agricultural lands, plots, and commercial units situated anywhere in India.\n\n2. REVENUE & GOVERNMENT OFFICES: To represent me before Sub-Registrars, Mamlatdars, Collectors, Talatis, City Survey Offices, Municipal Corporations, and Torrent Power/UGVCL for mutation entries, tax payments, and approvals.\n\n3. BANKING OPERATIONS: To operate, manage, and conduct all transactions in my savings, current, and fixed deposit accounts, draw and sign cheques, demand drafts, and handle electronic transfers.\n\n4. LEGAL PROCEEDINGS: To institute, conduct, defend, compromise, or settle any civil, revenue, criminal, or consumer suits, applications, appeals, or petitions before any Court of Law, Tribunal, or Arbitrator, and engage Advocates on my behalf.\n\n5. SIGNING DOCUMENTS: To sign, verify, execute, and deliver all applications, affidavits, agreements, vouchers, declarations, and deeds required in connection with my affairs.\n\nAND I, the Principal, do hereby agree that all acts, deeds, matters, and things lawfully done by my said Attorney shall be deemed to have been done by me personally, and I hereby ratify and confirm the same.\n\nIN WITNESS WHEREOF, I have executed this General Power of Attorney at {{execution_place}} on this {{execution_date}}.\n\nPRINCIPAL / EXECUTANT:\n____________________________________\n({{principal_name}})\n\nACCEPTED BY ATTORNEY:\n____________________________________\n({{attorney_name}})\n\nWITNESSES:\n1. Signature: ____________________ (Name & Address)\n2. Signature: ____________________ (Name & Address)"
